msgstr "ການທົດສອບການເຂົ້າເຖິງພອດ '%1' ເທິງໂຮສ໌ '%2' ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ."

#. where %1 will be replaced by the queue name
#. and %2 will be replaced by the host name:
#. where %1 will be replaced by the queue name
#. and %2 will be replaced by the host name:
