msgstr "ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ CUPS daemon ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ"

#. PopupYesNoHeadline body:
#: src/modules/Printerlib.rb:459
msgid "A stop disrupts all currently active print jobs."
